      "rationale_from_source": "KMNIST: ensemble the parent reference network with newly trained, augmented CNNs.\n\nRationale (exploratory, not yet verified): the reference is a single ResNet-style CNN\ntrained with crop-only augmentation, at about 0.45% development error. Averaging the\npredictions of several independently seeded models usually lowers error. Mild\ngeometric augmentation (small rotation, scale, shear and translation, no flips) is\nplausible for handwritten characters. Hoped-for effect: an error drop of about 10% or\nmore relative to the reference.\n\nThe parent model is loaded from api.parent_dir and kept as one ensemble member.\nIf loading fails, only the new networks are used. Every learned state is stored in\nthe model dict. No development labels are used.",
